---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Diary — JiuYue" description="日常 · Diary">
  <div class="col-span-1 lg:col-start-2 py-8">
    <div class="card-base enable-card-border p-6 sm:p-8" style="border-radius: var(--radius-large);">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Diary</h1>
      <p class="text-sm opacity-60 mb-6">记录日常，像深海日志本 —— 支持 Markdown 时间线占位。</p>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <article class="rounded-xl border p-4" style="border-color: var(--line-divider); background: var(--card-bg);">
          <time class="text-xs opacity-40">2026-08-30</time>
          <h2 class="font-semibold mt-1">首篇 Diary</h2>
          <p class="text-sm opacity-70 mt-1">今天把 Mizuki 视觉 Token 完整移植到 Astro 7 + Workers，色调 hue=240。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border p-4" style="border-color: var(--line-divider); background: var(--card-bg);">
          <time class="text-xs opacity-40">2026-08-29</time>
          <h2 class="font-semibold mt-1">深海初探</h2>
          <p class="text-sm opacity-70 mt-1">在 oklch 里调色，像在深海里选光。</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
